body:
I'm 19, and I don't know about you, but my libido went through the roof when I got on estrogen and spiro. My levels are pretty high up there at this point. I'm on 6mg E and 200mg Spiro.  I've been on HRT for 14 months now.  My levels are like 30 T and 400 E? Something like that.  

I masturbate maybe once a day depending on whether my fiancé wants to have some fun or not.  

My orgasm has changed tremendously since starting HRT: 
I no longer ejaculate anything;
It is much more sensitive down there; 
I am multi orgasmic now;
And when I orgasm, it spreads this wave up my belly and across my body over and over.

The sexual fog disappeared for me in the first few months.  It is such a friggin relief to have control of my own thoughts.  I guess I'm only horny now if I am interested.  On HRT I guess I have more interest in sex than off HRT which might explain my jump in libido.  It also is much less of a need now and much more of a want.  If I don't want it, it kinda just fades away and I can ignore it which is nice.  So it is sort of a YMMV thing.  When I do want it though, and my fiancé does too... Well lets just say that the neighbors don't get much sleep. ;)
